@astermesh/pglite is a modified distribution of PGlite by Electric DB
Limited:

https://github.com/electric-sql/pglite

The AsterMesh distribution uses its own package identity and builds the
embedded PostgreSQL/WASM engine from the AsterMesh postgres-pglite fork.
Exact upstream and AsterMesh source revisions for each release are recorded
in the signed fork-lineage attestation associated with the package tarball:

https://github.com/astermesh/pglite
https://github.com/astermesh/postgres-pglite

